      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "Multiplying a matrix by a scalar is also straightforward. If $ M = aN $, where $ a $ is a scalar, then $ M_{ij} = aN_{ij} $. Each element of $ N $ is simply multiplied by the scalar. For example,",
