    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "the dot product is $ \\mathbf{a} \\cdot \\mathbf{b} = (1 \\times 4) + (2 \\times 5) + (3 \\times 7) + (4 \\times 9) = 71 $. Note that the dot product is not defined if the vectors have different lengths.",
